Package: falcon-engine
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip, postgresql, systemd
Recommends: ufw | firewalld
Maintainer: Falcon <root@localhost>
Description: Falcon Engine
 The server of the Falcon hierarchy system: it owns the database, the audit trail,
 the Global File Index and every machine's key. Installing this package puts the
 Engine's files in /opt/falcon/payload and adds the command falcon-engine-install.
 Run that command once, as root, to set the Engine up (see its --help); installing
 a newer package afterwards upgrades the Engine in place.
